  "typeCharacter": "Bricolage Grotesque is warm, chunky and a little quirky, like the rounded paw in the logo. It is set in heavy weights at very large sizes, sentence case and tight leading, for the h1, the service words and the phone numeral. Figtree carries all running text at a relaxed 18px in regular weight, with semibold only for day names and labels, never uppercase-tracked.",
  "composition": "Header on the mint #eef6f2 ground: the logo on the left (cols 1-4), a short text menu and one green #1d6f5a rectangular button with slightly rounded 6px corners on the right. Hero, the same ground: the h1 in Bricolage Grotesque extra-bold, deep green ink #10302a, about 7vw, across cols 1-7 over three lines; the lead in Figtree below it (cols 1-6); one primary button 'Pokličite' under it. Cols 8-12 hold a large single-line ink drawing of a curled sleeping cat, deep green line with one small coral #f0a493 accent on the nose, bleeding slightly off the right edge. Full-width emergency band in deep #10302a: on the left (cols 1-5), 'Nujni primeri imajo prednost' in Bricolage, light #e6f3ee; on cols 6-12 the phone as a huge Bricolage numeral in #e6f3ee, with a one-line Figtree note beneath it about the same number outside opening hours. Services 'Kaj vse delamo' on the mint ground: heading on cols 1-4 with a drawing of a dog lying with its chin on its paws below it; cols 5-12 hold a two-column list of the ten services in Bricolage semibold at about 30px, each separated by a thin #1d6f5a hairline rule. Next to 'Zobozdravstvo' sits a small ink drawing of a single animal tooth, the only accent. Hours and prices share a section on a #f8fcfa surface panel spanning cols 1-12. Hours are a seven-cell week strip across cols 1-7, each day in its own cell divided by vertical rules, with times in Figtree. Prices are a simple two-column ruled table on cols 8-12. Contact section in full-width primary green #1d6f5a: 'Pokličite nas in se naročite' in Bricolage, #f4faf7, on cols 1-6 with address, email and the parking note in Figtree. Cols 7-12 hold a simple schematic map: thin light lines on the green, one marked dot for Goriška cesta, and a small drawn rabbit sitting beside it. Slim deep-green footer.",
  "imagery": "No photographs anywhere. All art consists of single-weight continuous-line ink drawings in deep green #10302a on the plain mint ground: a curled sleeping cat (hero), a dog resting its chin on its paws (services) and a single tooth (small, beside dental). There is also a small sitting rabbit drawn in light #e6f3ee line on the green contact field. Each drawing stands alone on a plain ground, away from text, with no letters, people or hands, and only a tiny coral #f0a493 touch on a nose.",
  "signature": "Oversized, calm single-line drawings of resting patients, a cat, a dog and a rabbit, set against the huge emergency phone numeral on the deep green band.",
  "copy": {
    "headline": "Pse, mačke in zajce poznamo od smrčka do zob",
    "lead": "V ambulanti v Ajdovščini pregledamo, cepimo, čipiramo in operiramo male živali ter skrbimo za njihove zobe. Nujni primeri imajo prednost, na pregled se naročite po telefonu."
  },
  "imagePrompt": "A flat full-page screenshot of a desktop homepage, 1536x1024 px, with no browser window, no device frame and no perspective. Website for a small-animal veterinary clinic. Page ground is a very light mint #eef6f2 (cool, never cream). Headings use Bricolage Grotesque: extra-bold, chunky, friendly, sentence case, tight leading. Body text uses Figtree regular in deep green ink #10302a, with muted text #46625b. Header: the attached logo (green paw circle with the word Šapa) at the top left, a short text menu at the right and one dark green #1d6f5a button with slightly rounded 6px corners and light text #f4faf7. Hero on the mint ground, asymmetric on a 12-column grid: a huge three-line headline in Bricolage Grotesque, #10302a, spanning the left seven columns; a Figtree lead paragraph below it; one green button beneath. The right five columns show a large elegant single continuous-line ink drawing of a curled sleeping cat in deep green #10302a, with a tiny coral #f0a493 touch on its nose. The drawing sits on the plain mint ground, slightly bleeding off the right edge, with no text touching it. Below: a full-width deep near-black green band #10302a. On the left, a short bold statement in light mint #e6f3ee Bricolage. On the right, a very large phone number numeral in Bricolage, #e6f3ee, with one small line of Figtree text beneath. Next, a services section on mint: a heading at the top left with a single-line ink drawing of a dog lying with its chin on its paws below it. The right eight columns hold a two-column list of service names in Bricolage semibold, about 30px, each separated by thin green #1d6f5a hairline rules, with a small single-line drawing of one animal tooth beside one item. Next, a pale panel #f8fcfa holds an opening-hours week strip of seven cells divided by thin vertical rules on the left and a simple two-column ruled price table on the right. Next, a full-width green #1d6f5a contact section: heading and address text in #f4faf7 on the left; on the right a simple schematic street map in thin light lines with one marker dot, and a small single-line drawing of a sitting rabbit in light #e6f3ee line. Slim deep green footer. No photographs, no people, no faces, no gradients, no shadows, no pill buttons, no icon cards and nothing centred."
}

